  "details": "No clue how to reproduce and only know of one other person that have experienced the same thing. This is a problem that comes up from time to time. Have had it like 5 times before. Mostly on the Community Meetup.\n\nMy controllers start to vibrate in open air. Just like I'm touching an avatar. So if I set the sensitivity to 100 they are vibrating constantly.\n\nTouching another avatar doesn't change anything.\n\nSeems to be based on how quickly you move them through the air. Holding down triggers make them vibrate more.\n\nThey stop vibrating if i disable avatar haptics, start to vibrate again if I enable it again.\n\nRejoining the world solves the problem.",
